# Syntaur Protocol -- Agent Instructions

This is a reference template for the Codex and OpenCode adapters.

The `syntaur setup-adapter codex` or `syntaur setup-adapter opencode`
command generates `AGENTS.md` dynamically in your workspace with
project and ticket context filled in.

The generated file now does two things:

1. embeds the ticket-specific Syntaur protocol context
2. points Codex at the reusable Syntaur Codex plugin workflows (`syntaur-protocol`, `grab-ticket`, `plan-ticket`, `complete-ticket`, and related helpers) when that plugin is installed globally

See the rendered output by running:
  syntaur setup-adapter codex --project <slug> --ticket <id>
  syntaur setup-adapter opencode --project <slug> --ticket <id>
